e English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#airbnb-optimizes-usage-and-costs-case-study-it","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"airbnb-optimizes-usage-and-costs-case-study-it","dateCreated":"2024-11-12T00:55:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-12T01:13:39+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Airbnb ha aumentato la visibilità dei costi utilizzando il Report di costi e utilizzo AWS, ha ottimizzato i costi grazie al Piano intelligente Amazon S3 e ai Savings Plans, e ha acquisito conoscenze che l\u0027hanno aiutata a crescere in modo sostenibile.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Data%20Lake/200x100-airbnb.c677af0a005a40c80ec46059554211dfdc90ab98.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel","sortDate":"2022-01-07","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/airbnb-optimizes-usage-and-costs-case-study/","customer-name":"Airbnb","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Storia del cliente","headline":"Airbnb ottimizza utilizzo e costi tramite Savings Plans e dati fruibili sui costi in AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"customer-r